1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,425
A content type can hold more than text and numbers.

2
00:00:04,425 --> 00:00:08,571
In this video we'll add a Link Field, an Html Field, a Markdown

3
00:00:08,571 --> 00:00:12,717
Field, and a Youtube Field to a content type, fill them in, and

4
00:00:12,717 --> 00:00:14,700
see the result on the site.

5
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:22,511
Text, numbers and dates don't cover everything.

6
00:00:22,511 --> 00:00:27,055
A workshop page needs a sign-up link, a formatted schedule, a list of

7
00:00:27,055 --> 00:00:29,600
things to bring, and a teaser video.

8
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:35,514
A Link Field stores an address, the text of the link, and where the link opens.

9
00:00:35,514 --> 00:00:39,280
An Html Field stores formatted text, such as a schedule.

10
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:44,204
A Markdown Field stores text written in Markdown, such as a list.

11
00:00:44,204 --> 00:00:48,790
A Youtube Field stores the address of a video, and shows it in a player.

12
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:55,133
The Link Field, the Html Field, and the Youtube Field come with the Content Fields module.

13
00:00:55,133 --> 00:00:58,396
The Markdown Field comes with the Markdown module.

14
00:00:58,396 --> 00:01:00,960
You enable both under Tools, Features.

15
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:09,647
Content types are under Design, Content Definition, Content Types.

16
00:01:09,647 --> 00:01:13,669
Select Edit on the Workshop type, which already has a Title.

17
00:01:13,669 --> 00:01:17,020
Its Fields section is empty, so select Add Field.

18
00:01:17,526 --> 00:01:22,912
Enter Registration Link as the Display Name, and the Technical Name follows from it.

19
00:01:22,912 --> 00:01:25,426
Under Field Type, choose Link Field.

20
00:01:25,974 --> 00:01:27,920
Select Save & Configure.

21
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:31,034
The field is added, and its settings open.

22
00:01:31,532 --> 00:01:34,079
Required makes the address mandatory.

23
00:01:34,079 --> 00:01:37,159
The Text drop-down decides what the link says.

24
00:01:37,159 --> 00:01:41,662
Choose Text is required, so every link has words that people can read.

25
00:01:42,168 --> 00:01:46,550
Default value of the Target fills the Target box in each new item.

26
00:01:46,550 --> 00:01:50,505
Enter the value that opens the link in a new window or tab,

27
00:01:50,505 --> 00:01:52,148
and then select Save.

28
00:01:56,416 --> 00:01:58,603
Select Add Field again.

29
00:01:58,603 --> 00:02:05,316
Enter Schedule as the Display Name, choose Html Field, and select Save & Configure.

30
00:02:05,782 --> 00:02:09,957
Hint is help text that appears under the field in the editor.

31
00:02:09,957 --> 00:02:16,002
Sanitize Html is on by default, and it removes unsafe markup when the content is displayed.

32
00:02:16,494 --> 00:02:20,267
The Standard editor is for people who write HTML markup.

33
00:02:20,267 --> 00:02:23,979
The Wysiwyg editor shows formatted text with a toolbar.

34
00:02:23,979 --> 00:02:27,874
Choose Wysiwyg editor from the drop-down, and select Save.

35
00:02:32,127 --> 00:02:33,611
Add one more field.

36
00:02:33,611 --> 00:02:39,427
Enter What to Bring as the Display Name, choose Markdown Field, and select Save & Configure.

37
00:02:39,910 --> 00:02:44,701
A Markdown Field has the same two settings, Hint and Sanitize Html.

38
00:02:44,701 --> 00:02:50,740
The Standard editor is a plain text box, and the Wysiwyg editor option adds a toolbar.

39
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:53,300
We keep Standard and select Save.

40
00:02:57,544 --> 00:02:59,803
The last field is the video.

41
00:02:59,803 --> 00:03:06,184
Enter Teaser Video as the Display Name, choose Youtube Field, and select Save & Configure.

42
00:03:06,664 --> 00:03:11,690
Placeholder shows sample text in the empty box, and Hint adds help text.

43
00:03:11,690 --> 00:03:15,105
Width and Height set the size of the video box.

44
00:03:15,105 --> 00:03:16,264
Select Save.

45
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:21,140
The Workshop type lists all four fields, each with its field type.

46
00:03:25,421 --> 00:03:29,334
In the Content Types list, select Create New Workshop.

47
00:03:29,334 --> 00:03:32,791
The editor shows the Title and our four fields.

48
00:03:33,259 --> 00:03:35,528
Enter Pottery Basics as the Title.

49
00:03:35,528 --> 00:03:39,442
For the Registration Link, enter the address and the link text.

50
00:03:39,442 --> 00:03:42,959
The Target is already filled in from the field settings.

51
00:03:43,578 --> 00:03:46,061
The Schedule is a rich text editor.

52
00:03:46,061 --> 00:03:50,058
Type the days and times, and use the toolbar to format them.

53
00:03:50,550 --> 00:03:52,190
What to Bring takes Markdown.

54
00:03:52,190 --> 00:03:55,752
A line that starts with number signs becomes a heading, and lines that

55
00:03:55,752 --> 00:03:57,580
start with hyphens become a list.

56
00:03:58,056 --> 00:04:01,776
For the Teaser Video, enter the address of a video page.

57
00:04:01,776 --> 00:04:06,216
The field builds the embedded address itself when the item is saved.

58
00:04:06,685 --> 00:04:10,145
Publish saves the Workshop and makes it live on the site.

59
00:04:14,444 --> 00:04:18,946
Back in the Content Types list, select List Items on the Workshop row.

60
00:04:18,946 --> 00:04:23,804
In the row of Pottery Basics, View opens the published Workshop on the site.

61
00:04:24,277 --> 00:04:28,461
The Registration Link is an ordinary link with the words we typed.

62
00:04:28,461 --> 00:04:32,007
Because of the Target, it opens in a new window or tab.

63
00:04:32,522 --> 00:04:36,122
The Schedule keeps the formatting that we applied in the toolbar.

64
00:04:36,580 --> 00:04:39,840
What to Bring shows the Markdown as a heading and a list.

65
00:04:40,313 --> 00:04:44,568
The Teaser Video appears in an embedded frame, at the width and height

66
00:04:44,568 --> 00:04:46,247
from the field settings.

67
00:04:46,247 --> 00:04:50,223
With the address of a real video, the player loads in this frame.

68
00:04:54,423 --> 00:04:59,258
The Html Field and the Markdown Field have a Sanitize Html setting, which

69
00:04:59,258 --> 00:05:00,666
is on by default.

70
00:05:00,666 --> 00:05:05,808
When the content is displayed, unsafe markup, such as script tags, is removed.

71
00:05:05,808 --> 00:05:08,563
What you typed stays stored as written.

72
00:05:09,313 --> 00:05:14,331
By default, HTML that you type inside Markdown is shown as text, not as markup.

73
00:05:14,331 --> 00:05:17,933
And the Link Field rejects an address that isn't valid.

74
00:05:19,933 --> 00:05:24,737
The Link Field, the Html Field, the Markdown Field, and the Youtube Field

75
00:05:24,737 --> 00:05:28,811
bring addresses, formatted text, and video into your content.

76
00:05:28,811 --> 00:05:30,393
Thanks for watching.

